\newlabel{tab:S-language}{{B.3}{8}{\textbf {Cooperation by model, prompt language and payoff scale.} 40 dyads per entry. The final column is the range across the ten scales for that model and language; over all six models it runs from 0.080, for Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite in Arabic, to 0.855, for Grok 4.20 in English, so the scale sensitivity of a model is a property of the model and the language jointly}{table.B.3}{}}
