\newlabel{tab:S-persona}{{B.6}{9}{\textbf {Persona effect by model and payoff scale.} The cooperation rate of an agent instructed that it is cooperative minus that of an agent instructed that it is selfish, at each scale. The two leftmost columns are the scales at which every payoff printed is at most 1}{table.B.6}{}}
