\newlabel{tab:S-shapes}{{B.11}{11}{\textbf {Pairwise correlation between the model curves, five models.} Correlation of the ten-point cooperation-against-scale curves of each pair of the five models the main text reports. Six of the ten pairs are negative and the mean is $-0.10$, which is why averaging the curves cancels much of the movement}{table.B.11}{}}
